From: MrUnforsaken
Date: 2026-05-25
Subject: [PATCH 0015] Wire configurable preview resolution from advanced config

Connect Capture Resolution fields (width/height) from advanced config to ffmpeg camera preview.
CameraPreview::start() now takes width/height params.
start_camera_preview and capture_camera_frame accept optional width/height with 640x480 defaults.
FaceSetting reads config.advanced.capture.width/height and passes to FaceCapture.

